#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:80
#: 2411d515a7354873aabfb86be98f1ca9 41086c18dbaf41b49680ec159bc689b7
#: 88c74bbb8d3b423196c6a901375d2127 cab45d1964d74aebba5f88d5a4392901
msgid ""
"Rover has no altitude actions, but if it reaches the Cylindrical fence "
"boundary in either Steering or Acro modes, it will simply stop and not move "
"beyond it. In other modes, it will execute the "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`."
msgstr ""
"Rover 没有高度动作，但在 Steering 或 Acro 模式下到达圆柱形围栏边界时，将简单停止，不继续前进。在其他模式下，将执行 "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:83
