msgid ""
"RTL/HOLD,etc. means it will attempt RTL first, but if it can't switch to "
"that mode (ie for RTL, GPS lock is lost), it will attempt to switch to the "
"next,in this case HOLD."
msgstr ""
"RTL/HOLD 等表示将首先尝试 RTL，但如果无法切换到该模式（如 RTL 需要 GPS 锁定已丢失），则尝试切换到下一个，本例中为 HOLD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:109
#: 0dcaa166dffc4778a75eb660fbf84da2 590f5b4dd54142cd957fc4f8a6136e4c
#: 6a131c8eca234c71af6eac4ac6658cea ac6556d0db824b91aabeeb2d212018d0
msgid ""
"If :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` is setup, RTL actions will "
"attempt to avoid any fences as it returns."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page`，RTL 动作将在返回途中尝试避开任何围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:111
#: 1325eacf7672414596e0416d398a8880 7257da7cdf0d4f1d93819aa3363f4e16
#: a5711d54a70f418bad71c7c7ef51be39 d053eadd7b1741639d12b5b498a3bbff
msgid ""
"At the moment the fence is breached a backup fence is erected 20m further "
"out (or up).  If the vehicle breaches this backup fence (for example if the "
"vehicle is not set up correctly or the operator takes control but is unable "
"to bring the copter back towards home), the vehicle will execute the "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` again (and another backup fence an "
"additional 20m further out will be created if this is breached again)."
msgstr ""
"在围栏突破的瞬间，将在距离更远（或更高）20m 处建立备用围栏。如果飞行器突破此备用围栏（例如飞行器配置不正确或操作员接管控制但无法将飞行器带回 "
"Home），飞行器将再次执行 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` （如果再次突破，将在另外 20m "
"外创建另一个备用围栏）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:117
#: 128288dfce324f9cbfa0edfecb0b2d88 51360719dfa24100ae7b08053c602928
#: 76d20f090b31433899b97b6fe6035eee b50335c92fd64fa782b7b96bc5b2ba34
msgid ""
"If the vehicle eventually proceeds 100m outside the configured fence "
"distance, despite the backup fences, the vehicle will switch into LAND mode "
"(HOLD for Rover).  The idea being that it's clearly impossible to get the "
"vehicle home so best to just bring it down/stop it.  The pilot can still "
"retake control of course with the flight mode switches.  Like with the "
"earlier fences, another fence is erected 20m out which will again switch the"
" vehicle to LAND (HOLD for Rover), if it continues away from home."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器最终在配置围栏距离外飞行了 100m，尽管有备用围栏，飞行器将切换到 Land 模式（Rover 为 "
"HOLD）。理由是此时显然已无法将飞行器带回 "
"Home，最好直接让其降落/停止。飞行员当然仍可通过飞行模式开关重新接管控制。与之前的围栏一样，另一个围栏将在 20m 外建立，如果飞行器继续远离 "
"Home，将再次将其切换到 Land（Rover 为 HOLD）。"

