" execute the :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` below:"
msgstr ""
"如果启用，且围栏边界或高度（:ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>`）（如果非零）被超出，Plane 将执行以下 "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`："

