#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:91
#: 23824d93969f466e8674fa5000a9bfd4 35823a2904444315875962aae0863846
msgid "Guided to return point with pilot throttle control"
msgstr "Guided 模式返回点，飞手控制油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:96
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:99
#: 81fcf45cb481406da0df9673c56d8b5f c85be1a542de4f039646bd9ecb9315a7
msgid ""
"The return (and loiter) point, unless "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` is enabled, is the geometric center "
"of the breached fence boundary. If :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` is set "
"to a guided return mode (6 or 7), the altitude at which it returns is "
"determined by :ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` or if  "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` is zero, midway between the altitude "
"limits, if non-zero. If both altitude limits are zero, then it will return "
"at current altitude."
msgstr ""
"返回（和盘旋）点，除非启用了 :ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>`，否则为被突破围栏边界的几何中心。如果 "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` 设置为 Guided 返回模式（6 或 7），返回高度由 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` 决定，或者如果 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` "
"为零，则为高度限制的中点（如果非零）。如果两个高度限制都为零，则将在当前高度返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:101
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:98
#: 2f6400fdb0dd4ed08d7c041094a67fa7 9a7c53c2de004ce2949e429560292643
msgid ""
"The return point can also be replaced by the nearest rally point (See: "
":ref:`common-rally-points`) as a destination, if "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"返回点也可以被最近的集结点（见：:ref:`common-rally-points`）替代作为目的地，如果启用了 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:100
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:103
#: 95a63e35cb674397a7667e24a3870ad3 b3a7ffc377bb4cbaba27c2c1be5842aa
msgid ""
"while executing any action that requires a mode change (ie. all except "
"Report Only), any additional fence breaches are recorded but ignored. For "
"example, RTL that has an AutoLand will breach a MIN_ALT fence, if enabled, "
"but take no action and finish the landing."
msgstr ""
"在执行任何需要模式切换的操作（即除仅报告以外的所有操作）时，任何额外的围栏突破都会被记录但忽略。例如，具有自动降落的 RTL 将突破 MIN_ALT "
"围栏（如果启用），但不会采取任何行动并完成降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:102
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:105
#: 01a83ce2b17a4e8e9c56f3c836f37c2c 0b9670ac650a4a6ba7cffda9e8b3997d
msgid ""
"Modes changes cannot be executed after the fence breach unless the "
":ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` bit 0 is set to \"0\". By default it is "
"set to \"1\" to prevent mode changes. When set, the vehicle must return to "
"within the fence boundary in order to change modes. If mode changes are "
"allowed, you can also return to the mode that was active upon breach by "
"using an RC auxiliary switch set to option \"96\" (Re-read mode switch)."
msgstr ""
"除非 :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` 第 0 "
"位设置为「0」，否则突破围栏后无法执行模式切换。默认情况下设置为「1」以防止模式切换。设置后，飞行器必须返回到围栏边界内才能切换模式。如果允许模式切换，你也可以通过将设置为选项「96」（重新读取模式开关）的"
" RC 辅助开关返回到突破时的激活模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:128
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:131
#: 1eef4a3bc3ad45239d078211cfeed898 305f687a9516412398daccea94ef1fce
msgid ""
"When in Mode FBWB or CRUISE, Plane will attempt to limit altitude target "
"changes by the pilot (ie using Pitch stick for climb/descent rate demand "
"inputs) to avoid breaching a maximum or minimum altitude fence."
msgstr ""
"在 FBWB 或 Cruise 模式下，Plane 将尝试限制飞手（即使用俯仰杆输入爬升/下降速率需求）的目标高度变化，以避免突破最大或最小高度围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:167
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:170
#: 5247f454d0574b48aa88fc7e8249284e f5e224ed84e043338a9e101d5c120fae
msgid "Stick-mixing on fence breach"
msgstr "突破围栏时的杆量混合"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:169
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:172
#: 4776f694a3fb479eb400e58908676bd2 b4b4d12865af419a9c5e8d5d4feb05b4
msgid ""
"ArduPilot enables 'stick mixing' by default when in auto modes. This means "
"that you can change the path of a loiter, for example, by using your "
"transmitter sticks."
msgstr "ArduPilot 在自动模式下默认启用「杆量混合」。这意味着你可以通过使用遥控器摇杆来改变盘旋路径等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:173
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:176
#: 386ce24fed4e49d6a4a62c50405c25ff e6612aba65e34c248bcfa9d81a0ae272
msgid ""
"When you are using geo-fencing, stick mixing will be disabled on fence "
"breach until your plane is back inside the fenced region. This is to ensure "
"that the bad control inputs that caused you to breach the fence don't "
"prevent it from recovering to the return point."
msgstr "当你使用地理围栏时，突破围栏后将禁用杆量混合，直到飞机返回围栏区域内。这是为了确保导致你突破围栏的错误控制输入不会妨碍飞机恢复到返回点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:178
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:181
#: 4088c544462a46e1a48ba5264dee62ab b313fcb61a964d3b8b12344a09ce2b4e
msgid ""
"As soon as you are back inside the fence stick mixing will be re-enabled, "
"allowing you to control the GUIDED mode that the plane will be in. If by "
"using stick mixing you manage to take the plane outside the fence again then"
" stick mixing will again be disabled until you are back inside the fence."
msgstr ""
"一旦你返回围栏内，杆量混合将重新启用，允许你控制飞机将处于的 Guided "
"模式。如果通过杆量混合再次将飞机带出围栏，则杆量混合将再次被禁用，直到你重新回到围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:17
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:21
#: 1abe6b13b03d4798ab9afdcd6c838faa 1c92af414f1d48b5a7844184a4322b5b
#: 594b368baff841f6bb9f223d42a5ddb3 8e16b1634d7e4690a4a677b722def9ce
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` Set bit 1 to prevent mode changes "
"after a fence breach until the vehicle returns within the fence boundary "
"(Plane only, Copter/Rover do not allow mode changes while in breach). Set "
"bit 2 to use the Union of inclusion areas instead of just Intersects. Set "
"bit 3 to provide GCS warning when vehicle is less than "
":ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` from a breach. This parameter is also used"
" in avoidance and path planning."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>`。置位 bit 1 "
"可在围栏被突破后阻止模式切换，直到载具返回围栏边界以内（仅 Plane；Copter/Rover 在突破期间本就不允许切换模式）。置位 bit 2 "
"使用各包含区域的并集，而不是仅取交集。置位 bit 3 在载具距离突破围栏不足 :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` 时向"
" GCS 发出警告。该参数也用于避障和路径规划。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:121
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:138
#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:88
#: 0a11f79259d645479b2b323a92261915 66876314cb3f447787b0076ff8500f1b
#: 97f27aac37954df380cc82fa5f1757c8 aad7ab44f61542d6874773e38253382c
msgid ""
"if the Minimum Altitude fence is enabled by the switch while on the ground "
"and disarmed, a pre-arm failure will occur preventing arming."
msgstr "如果在地面且未解锁时通过开关启用了最低高度围栏，将出现解锁前检查失败，从而阻止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:95
#: a1427ac560764bc98b938c6f0999924b
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:95
#: c0d7be23efed44d4891d036fd36db978
msgid "AUTOLAND mode, or RTL"
msgstr "AUTOLAND 模式或 RTL"
